---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 16, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="The terms of service for NyankoTools, covering the service, prohibited activities, intellectual property, and disclaimers."
>
  <h1 class="mb-2 text-2xl font-bold">Terms of Service</h1>
  <p class="mb-8 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
    Last updated: {lastUpdated}
  </p>

  <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-8 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">
    <p>
      These Terms of Service (the "Terms") set out the conditions for using
      NyankoTools (the "Site"). By using the Site, you are deemed to have agreed
      to these Terms.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">1. Application</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms apply to all tools and content provided on the Site. By
        using the Site, you are deemed to have agreed to these Terms.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">2. Description of Service</h2>
      <p>
        The Site provides various free tools for text conversion, calculation,
        generation, and similar tasks. Every tool runs entirely as client-side
        processing within your browser, and data you enter is never sent to the
        Site's servers. See our
        <a
          href="/en/privacy-policy/"
          class="text-blue-700 underline hover:text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300"
        >
          Privacy Policy
        </a>{' '}
        for details.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">3. Prohibited Activities</h2>
      <p>When using the Site, you must not engage in any of the following:</p>
      <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
        <li>Acts that violate laws or public order and morals</li>
        <li>
          Acts related to criminal activity, or acts the Site determines to be
          related to criminal activity
        </li>
        <li>
          Acts that destroy or interfere with the functionality of the Site's
          servers or network (including excessive concentrated access)
        </li>
        <li>Acts that interfere with the Site's operation</li>
        <li>
          Acts that cause disadvantage, damage, or discomfort to other users or
          third parties
        </li>
        <li>
          Unauthorized reproduction, modification, or repurposing of the Site's
          content
        </li>
        <li>
          Unauthorized access, or attempted unauthorized access, to the Site's
          systems
        </li>
        <li>Any other act the Site deems inappropriate</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        Copyright and other intellectual property rights in the text, design,
        logos, and other content published on the Site belong to the Site or to
        third parties holding legitimate rights. Except where permitted by law,
        such content may not be reproduced, repurposed, or modified without
        authorization. The Site claims no rights whatsoever over data that users
        generate or convert using its tools.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">5. Disclaimer</h2>
      <p class="mb-2">
        The Site makes no warranty of any kind regarding the accuracy,
        completeness, or usefulness of the calculation, conversion, or
        generation results produced by its tools. The Site is not liable for any
        damages arising from use of the Site, including but not limited to those
        caused by data errors, tool malfunctions, or service interruptions or
        discontinuations.
      </p>
      <p>
        Even where links to other sites are placed on the Site, or links to the
        Site are placed on other sites, the Site bears no responsibility
        whatsoever for the content of any linked sites it has not deliberately
        chosen to publish.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">
        6. Changes, Suspension, or Termination of the Service
      </h2>
      <p>
        The Site may change its content, or suspend, discontinue, or terminate
        the service, without prior notice to users. The Site bears no
        responsibility for any damages this causes to users.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">7. Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p>
        The Site may change these Terms without prior notice to users when it
        deems necessary. Any revised Terms take effect as soon as they are
        posted on this page.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">8. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of
        Japan. Any disputes arising in connection with the Site shall be
        resolved through good-faith discussion between the parties.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">9. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For inquiries regarding these Terms, please contact us at the email
        address below.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm">nyankotools@gmail.com</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
